      "description": "Bullpen disclosed unauthorized transfers affecting approximately 18–19 accounts created during its April–June 2024 early beta. One affected user, Ansem, reported that his Solana wallet had been compromised, potentially through unauthorized access to his Bullpen profile, where its private key had been imported. Approximately $2.57M in assets was transferred or liquidated from the wallet and moved to Arbitrum through Relay. Bullpen disabled the affected test service while investigating the access vector and determining the full extent of user losses"
